#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the command SET_IMPORT_MODE that changes the mode of an import variable during a run. It starts with four imports being set for use in Simulink with IMPORT, but setting the mode to AVAILABLE. The connection to Simulink has an array with four signals, but the imported variables are not used in the VS Math Model at the start of the run.
#
#An Event is used to read a Parsfile dataset if either left wheel is close to lockup. The Event Parsfile changes the modes for the four Import variables from AVAILABLE to REPLACE, indicating to the VS Math Model that they should be used.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

